hat  happens in episode 3. buried in the  market are these easter egg looking eggs  i wonder if they have anything to do  with the teemo easter bunny skin you can  also make out a stone elemental creature  known as a krug from legends of  runeterra in benzo's shop you'll see  rabadon's death cap and item from the  game and over here you can see some  items that have since been removed like  the eye of ascension leandre's torment  and haunting guys i wasn't sure what the  mask on the left was so if you know  please leave a comment and as ekko  leaves the shop take a look at what's  over the doorframe yep mordekaiser's  helm episode 2 sees the use of  teleportation a major component of the  league of legends game other than this  scene we don't really see it utilized  that much it's here we meet young jace  now there's a lot of speculation around  who saved jason as mother the dominant  theory out there is that it's ryze who  is on a mission to collect world runes  we also see these rune markings on his  fingers but you might be asking yourself  i thought ryze's skin color was blue  actually there is a ryze skin called  young rise which shows him in his human  form and this is more in line with what  we see on the show but back to jace his  father ran the talus hammer business  which explains his iconic weapon which  will later be imbued with hextech and  there's heimerdinger whose assistant is  another champion victor and check out  this cool teemo video game in vander's  hideout there also appears to be a  gangplank inspired shooting range and  i'm not sure if these statues are  supposed to be cassiopeia cassie casey  hope cassiopeia whatever in this family  portrait of the kirimans you can see  caitlyn started shooting at a young age  holding this rifle in episode 3 amongst  a collection of jinx's things we can see  vi's full name violet this can also be  seen in episode 6 in the rubble of their  hideout in the back you can make out  these two colored wings a reference to  star guardian jinx check out these  shimmer barrels where you can make out  gragas's image on progress day we see  this undersea helmet and i just get  total nautilus vibes we also get a  demonstration of the hex claw which will  later become a key component of victor's  gear later we'll see jason heimerdinger  admiring the statue of stanwick pedidley  he was a former professor who in lol  lore resurrected ergot and stole credit  away from victor for his work in  creating blitzcrank now i thought this  was kind of interesting this is a  fish-like character we see now i know  fizz is supposed to be an amphibious  yordle but i wonder if this is the same  species or something else entirely now  this one might be a bit of a stretch at  first i thought this was nasus the shape  of the head the golden green colors and  the eye of horus egyptian-like symbol on  his hands this eye is called the eye of  zahn in runeterra lore and can be seen  later on in episode 6. nasus was  considered a demi-guide by the shirema  and here you can see a bunch of people  holding what appears to be eyes  worshiping him again it doesn't really  look like him but someone related to the  sharima people zuyan who is known as one  of the ascended who took the form of a  turtle this could totally be coincidence  but a few seconds later we see a  crocodile giving me total renekton vibes  and renekton is the brother of nasus we  also see a man's back being tattooed  with the symbol for a pentakill check  out this wooden rhino here in jinx's  hideout it resembles the same rhino  found in the get jinxed music video  while in the brothel we see these two  unknown individuals wearing kindred  masks and behind this absolutely sexy  yordle is a mask of blood moon twisted  fate when vi is walking through the  underground and imagined dragon song  plays with the actual band animated top  side we have an almost operatic like  performance in the style of the frail in  the roon terra universe the freljord  takes inspiration from norse mythology  caitlyn's truth card here looks like  some sort of vampire at first i thought  it could be vladimir but it's probably  just silco considering where the pin is  pointing to on the map in the next  episode where she goes hunting with  grayson her bullets are engraved with  her family's crest at an underground  food stand we get this delicious  creature which looks like it could be  related to gromp one of the jungle  creatures in league of legends in  marcus's daughter's room we get a brief  look at one of her books which contains  a bunch of teemos caitlyn finds this  shimmer addict who you may recognize as  huck the man vander save from those two  thugs in episode 1. in episode 6 we see  madarada painting something this turns  out to be the immortal bastion which is  under control of the noxus empire where  she hails from and another little teemo  here at the firelight space this is  pretty funny but a lot of people have  been saying this looks like an among us  character pretty suss if you ask me the  beginning of episode 7 has this stylized  intro featuring the fire lights check  out this letter z which kinda looks like  an hourglass interesting since echo z  drive has the ability to reverse time  this z drive is seen later on but it's  never had a power source quite like one  of these gemstones so it'll be  interesting how this comes into play in  season 2. check out these mechanical  dragonflies on jinx's table she actually  stole these from the progress day  festival in episode 4 and they'll go on  to be engineered as bombs in the bridge  bombing scene of episode 7. speaking of  that bridge when jinx arrives she hums  the same song that played at the  beginning of episode 1 where her parents  died with the arrival of mel's mother  ambassador medarda we learn mel's  brother has died this is likely jay  madarda who can be found in the legends  of runeterra card game when silco drinks  underneath the statue of vander we can  see ekko's name etched there the zanites  like creating memorials and paying  homage to the dead as referenced here  along the bridge and at the firelight  base okay i gotta put this in here it's  not really an easter egg but i love  skye's signature in the final episode we  see singed holding a pocket watch which  may be of his daughter orianna i get  more in depth with this in my season 1  ending explain video at the dinner  banquet vi is given a makeshift music  box by jinx the same music box powder  stole from jace's shop in episode 1.  jinx's rocket fish bones looks quite  similar to one of the pillows found in  the last drop's basement in that same  episode now i'm sure there are more  easter eggs out there if i've left  something out please leave a comment and  let me know what you thought of arcane  season 1. thanks for watching everyone  make sure to like and subscribe and for  more bad takes you can follow me on  twitter and instagram at thinkstoryyt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much  you

